{"type": "say", "text": "Alright everyone, we're two weeks out from the first production customer launch for the event-ingestion service. Both the streaming and hourly batch architectures have passed the functional test suite in dev, so now we need to make the binding architecture decision. Per our normal routine, I'd like to hear the final check from application architecture and the final check from compliance before I record the operating plan. Once both checks are heard, I'll record the decision using all constraints stated in those checks. Who's ready to go first?"}
